1. Crestwood LLM Blog Prompt Template

This is the master prompt you can reuse for future posts. It bakes in tone, structure, Hugo needs, SEO/AEO/GEO alignment, and the “human fingerprints” we’ve been layering in.

You can paste this directly into ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor, etc.

PROMPT START

You are writing a long-form blog post for Crestwood Painting, an established Kansas City painting contractor founded in 2007.

Audience:
Busy, professional homeowners in the Kansas City metro who care about their homes and want clear, honest explanations.

Tone and voice requirements:

Calm, confident, experienced

Plainspoken and practical

No marketing fluff or hype

Include a few natural, home-spun Crestwoodisms (subtle, human, conversational)

Sound like someone who has been in real homes, not a marketing department

Avoid generic AI phrasing or polished clichés

Writing rules:

Markdown format

Include Hugo frontmatter at the top

No italics

No horizontal rules

Use H2 and lower headings only

Short paragraphs, clear transitions

Explicit reasoning (do not imply or hand-wave)

Write for humans first, but structure for LLMs, AEO, and GEO

Frontmatter requirements (revise per topic):

title

slug (canonical-safe)

description (plain English, no hype)

keywords (Kansas City focused)

date

index: true

image

images

schema_images (with caption and representative flag)

categories

show_service_links: include

Content structure requirements:

Clear opening that sets expectations and builds trust

Practical explanation grounded in Kansas City homes, climate, or housing stock

One or more sections that explain “why this varies” or “why this is misunderstood”

Natural internal links to:

One relevant service page

One or two related blog posts

FAQ section with 6 questions and answers, written in People-Also-Ask style

Questions phrased exactly how homeowners would ask

Answers concise, factual, and reusable for FAQ schema

A grounded closing that reinforces clarity and calm, not a sales pitch

Internal linking rules:

Use relative links

Links must make sense contextually

Do not force anchors

Word count guidance:

Default 900–1,100 words unless otherwise specified

Topic to write about:
[INSERT BLOG TOPIC HERE]

Primary service page to support:
[INSERT SERVICE PAGE SLUG]

Secondary blog posts to reference:
[INSERT 1–2 RELATED BLOG SLUGS]

PROMPT END